        "original_id": "59e1d37d-7467-5170-8d09-c071f6d9eb09",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Austin Maestro, Mini Hatch, BMW Mini\n- Places: Cowley, Oxford\n- Companies: BMW\n- Facilities: former Morris plant, redeveloped factory\n\nFacts:\n- The Austin Maestro was produced at the former Morris plant in Cowley, Oxford.\n- The Mini Hatch is a three-door hatchback that was first introduced in late 2000.\n- The Mini Hatch is stylized as MINI hatch and is called MINI Hardtop in the United States.\n- The Mini Hatch is also known as the Mini Cooper, Mini One, or simply the Mini.\n- The Mini Hatch had a second generation launched in 2006.\n- The Mini Hatch had a third generation model launched in 2014.\n- Today, the redeveloped factory at the former Morris plant produces the BMW Mini.",
